{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6b59e429-eabb-82d2-9b43-e02c7035bc48",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T14:46:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Cristina Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:40:52-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:40:57-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. My name is Cristina Teixeira, and I'm calling about the catch basin, the storm drain, on the corner by me. Which, I have called, well, my neighbor said she was going to call, and I figured I'd just do it myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:41:24-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, happy to take it down. Where's the corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:41:30-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 428 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up in the North End. The drain is right at the corner there, next to my place. And it's been clogged with leaves since last Thursday. Last Thursday, so almost a full week now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:41:54-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 428 Admiral Kalbfus, catch basin at the corner, clogged with leaves since last Thursday. Got it. Is it backing up, or just not draining?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:42:10-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It just never drains. There's a big puddle sitting there, and it hasn't rained, that's the thing, it's been dry. No storm, nothing. It's just sitting there like a little pond. And you'd think it'd go down after a day or two, but no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, so a dry-weather puddle, the water's got nowhere to go. Is it out in the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:42:48-05:00",
      "duration": 44,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Out in the road, yes. And the cars are slowing to a crawl going through it, because nobody wants to splash or hit a hole under there. I watched a delivery truck practically stop yesterday. You know, this street, the old stone walls along it are older than the country, and they don't make roads like they used to, but you'd think the drains would at least get cleaned. [pause] Sorry, I wander."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, you're fine. So traffic's backing up a bit because of it. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:43:42-05:00",
      "duration": 28,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. And I want to know when they last came by. Like when was the last time anybody cleaned that basin? Because I've lived here a while and I can't remember a truck ever coming. My neighbor says maybe the fall, but I don't think so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:44:10-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning log in front of me on this screen. I can put in the request and ask them to note the last service date for you. Want a call back with that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:44:32-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please, because honestly this keeps happening. Every fall the leaves come down and it plugs up, and every time it's the same story. Nobody comes until somebody calls three times."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:44:51-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0182. That's my cell, so if it cuts out, just try again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:45:04-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0182. Okay, so I've got a clogged catch basin at the corner by 428 Admiral Kalbfus, leaves, standing water, slowing traffic, since last Thursday. I'll send it to the crew that does the drains and flag the question about the last cleaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:45:31-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And do you know about when? Because it's a week already."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:45:39-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "They tend to work through these in the order they come in, so it should be in the next few days. I'll mark it that it's been sitting since Thursday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:45:58-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I just don't want it to freeze, either, if it gets cold. Then it's ice in the road and that's worse."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good point, I'll add that to the note. Anything else on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:46:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T14:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
